{
  "id": "code_completion/scopes/22_include_delimiters",
  "topic": "code_completion",
  "subtopic": "scopes",
  "title": "Include delimiters",
  "summary": "An inserted `#include` takes quotes or angle brackets by the directory that finds the header, unless the configuration says otherwise",
  "prose": "A header next to the file or found through `-iquote` or `-I` takes quotes; one found through `-isystem` or `-idirafter` takes angle brackets. `angled_includes` and `quoted_includes` choose them by the header's path instead, and a header both match takes quotes. The standard library's headers always take angle brackets.",
  "status": "partial",
  "issues": [],
